The Backup subsystem safeguards the accumulated intelligence of the LEGAiSEE CommandCenter.

It protects the knowledge, relationships, investigations, operational history, and institutional memory that define the value of the Intelligence Operating System.

A functioning system can be rebuilt.

Lost knowledge often cannot.

---

